{"reviewId": "290925845_86CzxDSw7", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "滞胀：物价涨，经济停滞或负增长，货币购买力下降（受益资产—黄金、大宗商品、抗通胀债券、必须消费）\n通缩：物价跌，经济衰退或低增长，货币购买力上升（受益资产—现金、国债、高等级债券、防御性消费）", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "4712-4780", "abstract": "康波从萧条向回升的转换本质上就是从滞胀向通缩的转换，此时经济增速不断下降，商品价格明显回落，通缩成为社会的共识，这个过程也有10年之久。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "290925845_86CzxDSw7", "userVid": 290925845, "topics": [], "createTime": 1770041503, "userEditTime": 1775719800, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 290925845, "name": "大漏斗💦", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEK8Huks22Wr4EQ7mt0GK864UdM2mtA0pDEk3QLibxC2ykeEQkXCgFaiaU0NWmbO57PP2gR0q8eF5Jaiap3oWpwEtDYzAJBUuFgzoBR8QhIw1icSTg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "大漏斗💦", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "杂食读者 | 且思且行", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 91, "likes": [{"userVid": 289808623, "name": "苍穹", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/P7QXFib0UYxgFjkapEib0VorOkcQ7ErfwH9EibWoaV3jxjc1sOiaxJic0JkZrkTc1XFf5UVjgQYhwiaXRiaxrr2o5KEtg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-E-0-0-0", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments":